  {
    "id": "new-mixed-31",
    "sourceId": "mixed:31",
    "exam": "DP-600",
    "stemHtml": "<p>You want to include data in an external Azure Data Lake Store Gen2 location in your lakehouse, without the requirement to copy the data. What should you do?</p>",
