      }
    ],
    "controls": [],
    "mode": "single",
    "answers": [
      "B"
    ],
    "explanationHtml": "<p>A OneLake shortcut points to data in an external ADLS Gen2 location so it can be queried from the lakehouse without copying it. Pipelines and dataflows both copy the data.</p>Key verified against the documentation.",
