  {
    "id": "new-mixed-34",
    "sourceId": "mixed:34",
    "exam": "DP-600",
    "stemHtml": "<p>You’ve loaded a Spark dataframe with data, that you now want to use in a delta table. What format should you use to write the dataframe to storage?</p>",
    "contextHtml": "",
    "options": [
