  {
    "id": "new-mixed-38",
    "sourceId": "mixed:38",
    "exam": "DP-600",
    "stemHtml": "<p>What is the benefit of storing different layers of your lakehouse in separate workspaces?</p>",
    "contextHtml": "",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "It can enhance security, manage capacity use, and optimize cost-effectiveness."
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "It makes it easier to share data with colleagues."
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "There’s no benefit of storing different layers of your lakehouse in separate workspaces."
      }
    ],
    "controls": [],
    "mode": "single",
    "answers": [
      "A"
    ],
    "explanationHtml": "<p>Separate workspaces per layer let you isolate access (for example, only the analytics team sees the Gold layer), place layers on different capacities, and control costs per layer.</p>Key verified against the documentation.",
    "images": [],
    "refs": [],
    "blockers": [],
    "sourceRecords": [
      "mixed:38"
    ],
    "review": "Source-supplied answer; not independently validated",
    "revealImages": [],
    "caseLabel": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "new-mixed-39",
    "sourceId": "mixed:39",
    "exam": "DP-600",
    "stemHtml": "<p>What is the benefit of using Fabric notebooks over manual uploads for data ingestion?</p>",
    "contextHtml": "",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "Notebooks provide an automated approach to ingestion and transformation."
