        "id": "C",
        "text": "Notebooks offer a user-friendly, low-code experience for large datasets."
      }
    ],
    "controls": [],
    "mode": "single",
    "answers": [
      "A"
    ],
    "explanationHtml": "<p>Notebooks let you script ingestion and transformation in Spark and run it on a schedule, so the process is repeatable and automated instead of a manual upload each time.</p>Key verified against the documentation.",
