  {
    "id": "new-json-t1q91",
    "sourceId": "json:T1Q91",
    "exam": "DP-600",
    "stemHtml": "<pre>You have a Microsoft Power BI report named Report1 that uses a Fabric semantic model.\nUsers discover that Report1 renders slowly.\nYou open Performance analyzer and identify that a visual named Orders By Date is the slowest to render. The duration breakdown for Orders By\nDate is shown in the following table.\nWhat will provide the greatest reduction in the rendering duration of Report1?</pre>",
    "contextHtml": "",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "Enable automatic page refresh."
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "Optimize the DAX query of Orders By Date by using DAX Studio."
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "Change the visual type of Orders By Date."
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "Reduce the number of visuals in Report1."
      }
    ],
    "controls": [],
    "mode": "single",
    "answers": [
      "D"
    ],
    "explanationHtml": "<pre>Read the breakdown and follow the biggest number:\n\n| Name | Duration (ms) |\n| --- | --- |\n| DAX query | 27 |\n| Visual display | 39 |\n| **Other** | **1,047** |\n\n**&quot;Other&quot; is 94% of the total.** Microsoft defines it as *&quot;the time required by the visual for preparing queries, **waiting for other visuals to complete**, or performing other background processing.&quot;* A dominant *Other* time therefore points at **contention between visuals**, not at this visual&#x27;s own work — and the documented remedy is to reduce how many visuals are on the page. Hence **D**.\n\n- **B — optimize the DAX query.** The DAX query is **27 ms**. Even eliminating it entirely saves 2.5% of the render time.\n- **C — change the visual type.** That would target *Visual display*, another 39 ms. Same problem.\n- **A — automatic page refresh.** Re-runs queries on a timer. It adds load; it removes none.</pre>",
    "images": [],
    "refs": [
      {
        "title": "Performance analyzer in Power BI Desktop",
        "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/power-bi/create-reports/desktop-performance-analyzer?wt.mc_id=studentamb_657938"
      }
    ],
    "blockers": [
      "Original question exhibit files not supplied: p240_i1.png"
    ],
    "sourceRecords": [
      "json:T1Q91"
    ],
    "review": "Source-supplied answer; not independently validated",
