  },
  {
    "id": "new-hub-dumps-48-r48",
    "sourceId": "study-hub:dumps:48",
    "exam": "DP-600",
    "stemHtml": "<p>You have a Fabric tenant that contains a data pipeline. You need to ensure that the pipeline runs every four hours on Mondays and Fridays. To what should you set Repeat for the schedule?</p>",
    "contextHtml": "",
    "options": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "text": "Daily"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "text": "By the minute"
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "text": "Weekly"
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "text": "Hourly"
      }
    ],
    "controls": [],
    "mode": "single",
    "answers": [
      "C"
    ],
    "explanationHtml": "<p>Answer C : Weekly.</p>\n<p>The only way to do this is to set the schedule to &#x27;&#x27;Weekly&#x27;&#x27;, set the days on Monday and Friday and add manually 6 Time of 4 hour intervals.</p>\n<p>You need the pipeline to run every four hours on Mondays and Fridays.</p>\n<p>Weekly scheduling allows you to specify particular days of the week (e.g., Monday and Friday).</p>\n<p>Within the weekly schedule, you can set the pipeline to repeat every 4 hours.</p>",
    "images": [],
    "refs": [],
    "blockers": [],
    "sourceRecords": [
      "study-hub:dumps:48:row48"
    ],
    "review": "Source-supplied answer; not independently validated",
    "revealImages": [],
    "caseLabel": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "new-hub-dumps-49-r49",
    "sourceId": "study-hub:dumps:49",
    "exam": "DP-600",
    "stemHtml": "<p>You need to recommend a solution to group the Research division workspaces. What should you include in the recommendation? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area. NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.</p>\n<p>Answer Area</p><ul><li>Grouping method: Capacity / Domain / Tenant</li><li>Tool: OneLake data hub / The Fabric Admin portal / The Microsoft Entra admin center</li></ul>",
    "contextHtml": "",
    "options": [],
    "controls": [
      {
        "id": "d1",
        "label": "Grouping method:",
        "options": [
          "Capacity",
          "Domain",
          "Tenant"
        ],
        "answer": "Domain"
      },
      {
        "id": "d2",
        "label": "Tool:",
        "options": [
          "OneLake data hub",
          "The Fabric Admin portal",
          "The Microsoft Entra admin center"
        ],
        "answer": "The Fabric Admin portal"
