  {
    "id": "new-hub-dumps-56-r56",
    "sourceId": "study-hub:dumps:56",
    "exam": "DP-600",
    "stemHtml": "<p>You have a Fabric tenant that contains three users named User1, User2, and User3. The tenant contains a security group named Group1. User1 and User3 are members of Group1. The tenant contains the workspaces shown in the following table. The tenant contains the domains shown in the following table. User1 creates a new workspace named Workspace3. You assign Domain1 as the default domain of Group1. For each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No. NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.</p>\n<p>Workspace admins — Workspace1: User1, Workspace2: User2. Domain admins — Domain1: User1, Domain2: User2.</p>\n<p>Answer Area</p><ul><li>User2 is assigned the Contributor role for Workspace3. — Yes / No</li><li>User3 is assigned the Viewer role for Workspace3. — Yes / No</li><li>User3 is assigned the Contributor role for Workspace1. — Yes / No</li></ul>",
    "contextHtml": "<div><div>Exhibit (transcribed): Workspaces</div><div><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Admin</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Workspace1</td><td>User1</td></tr><tr><td>Workspace2</td><td>User2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div><div>Exhibit (transcribed): Domains</div><div><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Admin</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Domain1</td><td>User1</td></tr><tr><td>Domain2</td><td>User2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
    "options": [],
    "controls": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "label": "User2 is assigned the Contributor role for Workspace3.",
        "options": [
          "Yes",
          "No"
        ],
        "answer": "No"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "label": "User3 is assigned the Viewer role for Workspace3.",
        "options": [
          "Yes",
          "No"
        ],
        "answer": "No"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "label": "User3 is assigned the Contributor role for Workspace1.",
        "options": [
          "Yes",
          "No"
        ],
        "answer": "No"
      }
    ],
    "mode": "controls",
    "answers": [],
    "explanationHtml": "<p>Workspace roles are granted on the workspace, not through domains or groups. User2 has no role on Workspace3, User3 has no role on Workspace3, and User3 has no role on Workspace1, so all three statements are No.</p>",
    "images": [],
    "refs": [],
    "blockers": [],
