    "exam": "PL-300",
    "stemHtml": "<p>You have a folder that contains 50 JSON files. You need to use Power BI Desktop to make the metadata of the files available as a single dataset. The solution must NOT store the data of the JSON files. Which type of data source should you use, and which transformation should you perform? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area. NOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.</p>\n<p>Answer Area</p>\n<ul><li>Data source type: Folder / JSON / Text/CSV</li><li>Transformation: Combine the files of the Content column. / Delete the Attribute column. / Delete the Content column. / Expand the Attribute column.</li></ul>",
    "contextHtml": "",
