    "explanationHtml": "<p>A. Web.</p>\n<p>E. SharePoint folder.</p>\n<p>To connect to an Excel file stored in OneDrive and ensure it can be refreshed in PowerBI.com, the Web and SharePoint folder connectors are the best options. Therefore, the correct answers are A and E.</p>",
