    "stemHtml": "<p>You have the Power BI model shown in the following exhibit.</p>\n<p>There are four departments in the Departments table. You need to ensure that users can see the data of their respective department only. What should you do?</p>",
    "contextHtml": "<div><div>Exhibit (transcribed): Power BI model</div><div><table><thead><tr><th>Table</th><th>Fields</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Departments</td><td>DepartmentID, DepartmentName</td></tr><tr><td>ConfidentialData</td><td>DepartmentID</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Relationship:</b> Departments (1) → ConfidentialData (*), single cross-filter direction from Departments.</p></div>",
